;;;; appendix-a.scm - test vectors from RFC 8949 Appendix A
;;;
;;; Each entry is (HEX ROUNDTRIP EXPECTED).  EXPECTED is either
;;; (decoded VALUE), where arrays are vectors, maps are (map (key . value) ...)
;;; and null is the symbol null, or (diagnostic STRING) in RFC 8949
;;; diagnostic notation.  ROUNDTRIP is #t when re-encoding the decoded
;;; item in preferred form gives back the same bytes.
;;; Converted from appendix_a.json of the cbor/test-vectors collection,
;;; which follows RFC 7049.  Its example simple(24), encoded f818, is
;;; left out: RFC 8949 classes that encoding as not well-formed.

